straints into an LED display specification that can be installed, maintained and expanded with confidence.</p><p>Start with the audience and environment, then confirm pixel pitch, brightness, processing, power access and serviceability. Our engineering team can review drawings, recommend a suitable display family and coordinate the practical requirements for delivery and commissioning.</p></div><nav class=\"seo-content-block__links\" aria-label=\"Related Brightluxx resources\"><a data-testid=\"seo-internal-link-products\" href=\"/products\">Explore LED displays<span>→</span></a><a data-testid=\"seo-internal-link-solutions\" href=\"/solutions\">Plan a solution<span>→</span></a><a data-testid=\"seo-internal-link-resources\" href=\"/resources\">Technical resources<span>→</span></a><a data-testid=\"seo-internal-link-contact\" href=\"/contact\">Talk to an engineer<span>→</span></a></nav></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"site-footer\" data-testid=\"footer\"><div class=\"site-footer__inner\"><section class=\"site-footer__brand\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" alt=\"Brightluxx\"/></a><p>Premium LED display solutions for UAE and MENA. Established since 2005.</p><div><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"Instagram\" data-testid=\"footer-social-instagram\">◎</a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" data-testid=\"footer-social-linkedin\">in</a></div></section><section><h2>EXPLORE</h2><a href=\"/products\">PRODUCTS</a><a href=\"/solutions\">SOLUTIONS</a><a href=\"/technology\">TECHNOLOGY</a><a href=\"/case-studies\">CASE STUDIES</a><a href=\"/blog\">BLOG</a></section><section><h2>LOCATIONS</h2><a href=\"/dubai\">DUBAI</a><a href=\"/abu-dhabi\">ABU DHABI</a><a href=\"/saudi-arabia\">SAUDI ARABIA</a><a href=\"/qatar\">QATAR</a><a href=\"/kuwait\">KUWAIT</a><a href=\"/bahrain\">BAHRAIN</a><a href=\"/oman\">OMAN</a></section><section><h2>COMPANY<